@namespace OmniEurope.Blazor.Components
@inherits OmniComponentBase

@* The wait of a page: a slightly see-through layer with the application's own logo at its centre. Nothing here animates;
   the wait is told in words to assistive technologies (the logo is decorative) and the veil only shows once
   the wait has lasted 100 ms, a delay the stylesheet keeps (no timer, so a wait that ends sooner removes the
   element before it was ever visible). The element itself is OmniPageVeilSurface. Inside an OmniMain the
   veil draws nothing here: the main area draws it over its own frame, so no ancestor of the veil, a
   positioned card for example, can capture it or scroll it. Anywhere else it is drawn in place, fixed to
   the viewport. *@
@if (_host is null)
{
    @Surface
}
